{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"ja","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-20000","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-20000-item-ItemConfigEquipment-20000-0","text":"巡狩の運命専用の光円錐、光円錐のスキルはこの運命にのみ有効。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-20000-item-ItemConfigEquipment-20000-1","text":"凝縮された時間から得られる希薄な力。一瞬にも満たない刹那が、壮絶な運命を織りなす。\n\n「狩人の目が最も澄んでいるのは、矢が弦にかかり、鹿を仕留めるために弦を引く瞬間」","speaker":""}]}
